ind":"announcement","title":"Racketeering Tech Demo — Now Playable!","summary":"The Racketeering Tech Demo is now live! This is an early look at Racketeering, so expect bugs, rough edges, and performance issues. We wanted to give you a chance to experience our vision for the game and help test its growing systems, including multiplayer, jobs, driving, and more.We’ll continue adding updates and content to the demo. Take a look below to see more of what’s coming to Racketeering. If you'd like to get involved more in the development of Racketeering or just give feedback feel f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T02:11:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688553","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1799440-1845383656375699","game_id":"steam-1799440","kind":"announcement","title":"RACKETEERING — DEVELOPMENT BLOG #2","summary":"In July, our first development blog introduced the foundations of Racketeering: physical items, cultivation, processing, vehicles, a growing world and the ambition to make it all work in co-op. Over August and September, we've been joining those pieces together. This update is about what has changed and what those systems now let us build. Development is still moving quickly as we work towards a playable demo. The systems described here are at different stages of development, and some still need","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T22:19:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656375699","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1799440-1839041357022658","game_id":"steam-1799440","kind":"announcement","title":"RACKETEERING — DEVELOPMENT BLOG #1","summary":"WELC